// Iteration 5, postfx: Rec Room's own post-processing per room (Core/RrPostFx + RrPostFxProfiles). Every pair is the
// same camera rendered with post-processing on ("post": true): "_before" with our Volume held at weight 0
// (RrPostFx.TestOff: the client's/project's default profile only - no tonemapping, no bloom), "_after" with Rec
// Room's profile for the room (RrPostFx.TestOn). Dorm = the blank Studio scene's house profile, Rec Center = cache
// 1AF's RecCenter_071825 profile, Golden Trophy lobby and acts = GoldenLobby's, Dodgeball and Paintball = house.
// In act 4 (lava): a bloom probe (intensity x8: what is bright enough to glow) and the headset's bloom chain.
// The last step loads the install's own VolumeProfile (StuntRunner_Default_SSFX_Profile) and compares it with the data.
{
  "name": "postfx_tour",
  "steps": [
    {"goto": "Dorm", "timeout": 240},
    {"wait": 2},
    {"expect_log": "PostFx: Dorm:", "timeout": 5},
